WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:01,910
Who is it this morning, dad?

2
00:00:03,740 --> 00:00:05,540
Dad didn’t know it was fish like this

3
00:00:05,540 --> 00:00:07,140
Then just reluctantly forgive dad this time.

4
00:00:07,340 --> 00:00:08,340
Dad, stop sleeping in

5
00:00:08,340 --> 00:00:10,540
Come to the airport to pick up the fish quickly. You are back.

6
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:11,740
The plane landed at half past seven

7
00:00:14,340 --> 00:00:18,010
Why did it open so early today? When I came back

8
00:00:18,010 --> 00:00:19,810
I saw someone waiting at the door to buy something

9
00:00:20,210 --> 00:00:22,830
Just let them in first, okay?

10
00:00:23,030 --> 00:00:28,330
They all take the initiative to work overtime. The fish is back again. I'll pick it up at the airport.

11
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:41,060
The fish is here. It’s been a hard day on the road.

12
00:00:41,060 --> 00:00:42,060
Have you had breakfast?
